# text = ꞽr tm ⸗k ṭr čw ḥr ś.t ⸗k [wꜣḥ] [⸗k] [śꜥḥ] [⸗k] [r] [tꜣ] ꞽw.kꜣ Wnꞽś ḥr ⸗f m Wr pw nb ꜣ.t wśr m nkn.t ꞽm ⸗f rč̣.kꜣ [⸗f] [nśr] [n] [ꞽr.t] [⸗f] pẖr ⸗ś ḥꜣ ⸗čn (w)ṭ ⸗ś nšn m ꞽr.w ꞽr.wt ḫfḫf<.t> ⸗ś m pꜣw.t(ꞽ)w pw sḫ.kꜣ [⸗f] [ꜥw](.wꞽ) [Šw] [ẖr](.ꞽ) [Nw.t] wṭ.kꜣ Wnꞽś rmn ⸗f m snb.t tw rmn.t ⸗k ꞽr ⸗ś
# lit = "If you do not remove yourself from your place or lay your insigna on the ground for Unas, then Unas will come, his face being that of this Great One, the lord of power who is strong though that which was injured to him, then he will give flame to his eye, that it will encompass you, and set storm among those who did deeds and its outburst among those original gods, then he will smite away the arms of Shu who is under Nut, then this Teti will thrust his shoulder into that rampart on which you lean."
# trans = "If you do not remove yourself from your place or lay down your insigna for Teti, then this Teti will come, his face being that of this Great One, the lord of power who is strong though that which was injured to him, then he will put flame in his eye, that it will encompass you, and set storm among those who did deeds and its outburst among those original gods, then he will smite away the arms of Shu who supports Nut, then this Teti will thrust his shoulder into that rampart on which you lean."
