# text = ꞽr tm ⸗k ṭr čw ḥr ś.t ⸗k wꜣḥ ⸗k śꜥḥ ⸗k r tꜣ n Ttꞽ pn ꞽw.kꜣ Ttꞽ pn ḥr ⸗f m Wr pw nb ꜣ.t wśr m nkn.t ꞽm ⸗f rč̣.kꜣ Ttꞽ pn nśr n ꞽr.t ⸗f pẖr ⸗ś ḥꜣ ⸗čn (w)ṭ ⸗ś nšn m-m ꞽr.w ꞽr.wt ḫfḫf.t ⸗ś m pꜣw.t(ꞽ)w ꞽpw sḫ.kꜣ ⸗f ꜥw.w(ꞽ) Šw ẖr(.ꞽ) Nw.t wṭ.kꜣ Ttꞽ pn rmn ⸗f m snb.t tw rmn.t ⸗k r ⸗ś
# lit = "If you do not remove yourself from your place or lay your insigna on the ground for Teti, then this Teti will come, his face being that of this Great One, the lord of power who is strong though that which was injured to him, then this Teti will give flame to his eye, that it will encompass you, and set storm among those who did deeds and its outburst among those original gods, then he will smite away the arms of Shu who is under Nut, then this Teti will thrust his shoulder into that rampart on which you lean."
# trans = "If you do not remove yourself from your place or lay down your insigna for Teti, then this Teti will come, his face being that of this Great One, the lord of power who is strong though that which was injured to him, then this Teti will put flame in his eye, that it will encompass you, and set storm among those who did deeds and its outburst among those original gods, then he will smite away the arms of Shu who supports Nut, then this Teti will thrust his shoulder into that rampart on which you lean."
