# lit = "Every god who will put his arm, when the face of Unas turns to you that he may worship you and call upon you on the body of Unas, O god, on his nose, O god, he will not send a sending, he will not overleap the barrier in the company of his bethren, the doors of the Nightboat will not be opened to him, the doors of the Dayboat will not be opened to him, his case will not be decided as one who is in his town and the doors of hmw.t will not be opened to him."
# trans = "Every god who will put his arm, when the face of Unas turns to you that he may worship you and call upon you on the body of Unas, O god, on his nose, O god, he will not send a message, he will not overleap the barrier in the company of his bethren, the doors of the Nightboat will not be opened to him, the doors of the Dayboat will not be opened to him, his case will not be decided as one who is in his town and the doors of hmw.t will not be opened to him."
