# lit = “When the two daugthers of the King of Lower Egypt, the two red ones, who on him sind, the two great ladies, bore you, Re summoned you from the zenith of the sky as Horus, Khenti-menutef, Satjuti, Lord of Sebut, as the jackal, the Governor of the Bows, as Anubis who presides over the Pure Land in order that he my set you as the Morning Star in the middle of the Filed of Rushes, you being seated on your throne.”
