# comment = According to Sethe UKPT IV: 103 (Gefüllt sind...). Discussion on r ⸗f, according to Sethe m must be a conjunction based on another text. However, all authors consider m ꜥb.w a prepostion + a noun. It is probably a non-projectivity construction, r ⸗f is used to emphasise the adverbial the word ꜥb.w.
